flowchart TD
    A[FCM send] --> B{UNREGISTERED?}
    B -->|No| C[Finalize outcome from provider response]
    B -->|Yes| D[Confirm same send once]
    D --> E{Confirmation result}
    E -->|Success| F[accepted]
    E -->|UNREGISTERED again| G[Logically deactivate token]
    G --> H[skipped_unregistered]
    E -->|timeout / 502 / 504| I[Keep token · delivery_unknown]
    E -->|retryable failure| J[Keep token · failed / retryable]
    E -->|other failure| K[Keep token · failed]
